WEBVTT

00:05.290 --> 00:06.550
HARÉ+GUU

00:07.630 --> 00:10.560
Fall in love, boys and girls

00:11.130 --> 00:14.190
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

00:14.830 --> 00:17.730
The passion, the way it was born

00:18.340 --> 00:21.330
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

00:21.940 --> 00:25.100
How the hips shake, mucho dizzying

00:25.540 --> 00:28.570
Amigo, that's risky for a kid

00:29.150 --> 00:32.240
If I were to kiss, I'd get sucked in

00:32.750 --> 00:35.410
Tonight, I want to see something scary

00:36.290 --> 00:38.390
Don't be afraid

00:38.390 --> 00:39.860
Going from one push after another

00:39.860 --> 00:41.960
The surprising feeling is nice

00:41.960 --> 00:43.660
And you end up dancing till morning

00:43.660 --> 00:45.600
LOVE LOVE LOVE

00:45.600 --> 00:48.960
TROPICANA

00:50.740 --> 00:53.830
Catch me in the shade under the palm tree

00:54.510 --> 00:57.770
Make me wait, more than down to the limit

00:58.080 --> 01:01.100
I'm sorry, but you're already addicted

01:01.680 --> 01:05.010
From the jungle you can't escape! Haré+Guu!

01:05.520 --> 01:08.380
Fall in love, boys and girls

01:08.950 --> 01:12.010
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

01:12.460 --> 01:15.550
The passion, the way it was born

01:16.160 --> 01:18.490
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

01:18.760 --> 01:22.000
HARÉ+GUU

01:22.000 --> 01:22.870
POKUTE

01:22.870 --> 01:23.870
POKUTE
Pokute.

01:23.870 --> 01:24.300
POKUTE

01:24.300 --> 01:28.310
POKUTE
It appears in many ancient myths and
legends about the jungle.

01:28.310 --> 01:28.610
POKUTE

01:28.610 --> 01:34.050
POKUTE
It is said that they arrived into this land with
the will of God commanding them to protect
the jungle from harm.

01:34.050 --> 01:34.550
POKUTE

01:34.550 --> 01:39.480
POKUTE
They are divine creatures loved and
worshipped by people, even today.

01:39.480 --> 01:44.420
Go with Chest Hair!

02:00.140 --> 02:01.370
And so...

02:01.770 --> 02:04.830
Today is the cooking class that you've all
been waiting for.

02:05.180 --> 02:07.840
Go and make me something yummy!

02:09.210 --> 02:11.010
Oh, Haré, are you feeling ill?

02:11.350 --> 02:12.610
Would you like to go to the nurse's office?

02:13.650 --> 02:15.310
No, don't worry about me.

02:16.150 --> 02:16.360
Why...

02:16.360 --> 02:16.920
Did you all bring your aprons?
Why...

02:16.920 --> 02:17.260
Did you all bring your aprons?

02:17.260 --> 02:18.190
Did you all bring your aprons?
After such an incident...

02:18.190 --> 02:18.590
After such an incident...

02:18.890 --> 02:19.290
Yup!

02:19.290 --> 02:19.860
Yup!
Why doesn't anyone remember anything?

02:19.860 --> 02:20.230
Why doesn't anyone remember anything?

02:20.230 --> 02:21.330
Make sure to thoroughly wash your hands
before starting to cook!
Why doesn't anyone remember anything?

02:21.330 --> 02:23.520
Make sure to thoroughly wash your hands
before starting to cook!

02:23.930 --> 02:24.830
Yup!

02:25.700 --> 02:29.570
No, this is exactly what Guu wants me to do
- to think about each thing that she does!

02:30.470 --> 02:32.940
All right, from now on, I'm going to ignore as
much of it as possible!

02:32.940 --> 02:33.910
Ignore, ignore, ignore ignore!

02:34.110 --> 02:36.770
Now, we have a special teacher
here with us today.

02:36.910 --> 02:39.340
A professional in cooking,
an expert at hunting.

02:39.750 --> 02:40.870
Let me introduce... Him!

02:45.750 --> 02:46.880
It's the elder!

02:47.220 --> 02:48.050
Fluff king!

02:48.220 --> 02:49.120
Cooking is...

02:49.860 --> 02:50.820
Love!

02:51.190 --> 02:52.120
Cooking is...

02:52.790 --> 02:54.350
Shouting from the soul!

02:54.960 --> 02:55.930
Cooking is...

02:56.600 --> 02:58.220
A stairway to heaven!

02:58.830 --> 03:00.560
Today's menu is...

03:01.500 --> 03:02.300
This!

03:05.170 --> 03:08.140
Wow, all right! It's pokute! Pokute!
They look good. I love them!

03:08.210 --> 03:12.340
Pokute has lots of polyphenals and carotene.
They're good for your body.

03:12.610 --> 03:14.550
Most of all it's an abundant food supply
around us.

03:14.810 --> 03:17.300
Today, we'll make
vegetable and pokute stir fry.

03:17.380 --> 03:20.320
All right?
The key to cooking is using your hips!

03:21.290 --> 03:23.020
Cook with power in your hips!

03:23.360 --> 03:27.520
Now, be careful of fire and cutting yourself
with the knives, and cook!

03:27.730 --> 03:28.350
Begin!

03:28.460 --> 03:29.520
Okay!

03:35.570 --> 03:37.160
I'll choke the pokute.

03:37.300 --> 03:38.360
Guu, you chop up the vegetables.

03:45.210 --> 03:46.610
Amazing!

03:49.110 --> 03:50.910
Amazing! You're so good!

03:51.320 --> 03:55.050
Nothing less from the elder's grandson.
Toposte sure is quick.

04:05.660 --> 04:08.500
Wow! That's amazing. You got all of it done
in an instant!

04:08.730 --> 04:11.670
Hey you haven't gone too far and cut your
hand up or anything, have you?

04:19.710 --> 04:20.610
Oops.

04:32.520 --> 04:33.510
Three-second rule.

04:34.290 --> 04:36.290
Ignore...ignore...ignore..ignore...

04:36.290 --> 04:36.950
Haré?

04:38.460 --> 04:39.330
What's wrong?

04:40.630 --> 04:41.830
Have you picked your pokute yet?

04:42.230 --> 04:42.720
Huh?

04:43.640 --> 04:45.970
They're gone. I put them all in a pile here.

04:46.040 --> 04:47.060
Haré, do you know where they went?

04:47.970 --> 04:49.630
They were all there a moment ago...

04:49.710 --> 04:51.070
That's strange.

04:51.910 --> 04:53.100
Did they run away?.

05:06.360 --> 05:07.150
It can't be?

05:08.190 --> 05:09.320
That's strange.

05:10.260 --> 05:10.960
Out with them!

05:14.970 --> 05:15.660
Hey!

05:15.870 --> 05:16.530
Tastes horrible.

05:16.640 --> 05:17.930
Oh, here they are.

05:18.940 --> 05:20.430
Hey, this pokute...

05:21.110 --> 05:22.100
It's really plump.

05:22.410 --> 05:24.070
You're right. It's so fat.

05:24.140 --> 05:25.270
These might be really good pokutes.

05:25.540 --> 05:27.010
I-I see. That's good.

05:27.550 --> 05:28.840
Why are they plump?

05:30.950 --> 05:33.180
And so, they're all done!

05:34.090 --> 05:36.850
Now, everyone find your seats.
It's time for a tasting.

05:36.960 --> 05:37.680
Sure!

05:37.790 --> 05:40.380
Whoa, but first, take your aprons off.

05:41.090 --> 05:42.560
Like this!

05:51.400 --> 05:53.100
Did the amount of hair actually increase?

05:53.340 --> 05:55.070
Stop talking about that.

05:55.240 --> 05:56.540
The meal will taste bad.

05:56.740 --> 06:00.270
You're an adult too, big brother.
Yours is so different.

06:00.550 --> 06:01.600
Don't make comparisons.

06:07.920 --> 06:09.110
What's wrong, Guu-chan?

06:09.250 --> 06:10.740
You haven't eaten a thing.

06:11.060 --> 06:12.680
Pokutes are really good for you.

06:13.120 --> 06:14.390
Guu eats small meals.

06:14.490 --> 06:15.960
She doesn't eat at home, either.

06:16.360 --> 06:17.950
What!?

06:18.600 --> 06:20.120
No, no, no!

06:20.330 --> 06:23.030
Children must eat plenty of everything! No!

06:23.270 --> 06:25.130
I will cast a small charm on you.

06:27.110 --> 06:30.870
Magical Touch, Enchanting Aroma!

06:31.340 --> 06:35.370
There, there. It's all right now.

06:36.080 --> 06:37.340
She got it after all.

06:37.620 --> 06:40.020
Haré, aren't you going to stop him? Guu is
being puff-puffed.

06:40.350 --> 06:42.750
Are you stupid? if I tried to stop him now,
he'd get me, too!

06:43.890 --> 06:46.020
Now you'll be able to eat anything.

06:50.000 --> 06:50.890
Hey, let's go home.

06:51.100 --> 06:52.890
Do your homework! Brush your teeth!

06:52.960 --> 06:53.790
Bye bye!

06:54.630 --> 06:56.690
Hey, let's go fishing. I found a great spot.

06:56.770 --> 06:57.930
Right now?

06:58.000 --> 06:59.300
Geez...

07:00.010 --> 07:01.370
Kids these days...

07:02.870 --> 07:04.270
To not eat all their pokute...

07:07.180 --> 07:10.270
Such heresy! When I was a child...

07:17.720 --> 07:18.950
What's wrong, Haré?

07:19.990 --> 07:21.320
Do you know where Guu is?

07:21.390 --> 07:22.290
I don't know where she is.

07:22.560 --> 07:24.760
Strange, did she go home ahead of me?

07:25.000 --> 07:25.930
I'm sure that's the case.

07:28.130 --> 07:29.230
What was that scream?

07:29.600 --> 07:30.660
It's from the cooking room.

07:35.410 --> 07:36.100
Toposte!

07:39.140 --> 07:40.410
What's wrong? Get a grip!

07:40.480 --> 07:42.110
Toposte! What happened?

07:49.850 --> 07:51.790
The hair... someone plucked out all the hair!

07:52.060 --> 07:53.520
G-Gramps!

07:53.760 --> 07:56.190
Gramps! Get a hold of yourself, Gramps!

07:57.100 --> 07:58.930
Gramps! What happened?

07:59.460 --> 08:04.300
A horrible...giant...black shadow...

08:05.740 --> 08:06.800
Gramps!

08:07.110 --> 08:09.370
Who, who did this!?

08:09.870 --> 08:10.840
Toposte...

08:11.280 --> 08:12.210
Elder...

08:12.610 --> 08:14.940
Come to think, I've heard of an old folktale.

08:16.010 --> 08:20.210
If you eat too many pokute, their friends
come seeking revenge...

08:54.090 --> 08:56.180
The pokute's revenge?

08:56.290 --> 08:57.250
Pokute's...

08:58.120 --> 09:02.030
Dummy, it's all because you ate pokute each
and every day, without getting tired of them...

09:04.400 --> 09:05.230
...pokute's took...

09:05.900 --> 09:06.920
...his chest hair...?

09:10.140 --> 09:11.970
What's so funny? This is a crime!

09:12.840 --> 09:14.270
But it's only chest hair.

09:14.370 --> 09:16.860
What would you do with the
chest hair you stole?

09:19.580 --> 09:21.570
Well, be careful when going home...

09:21.950 --> 09:22.910
...of all the pokutes.

09:24.380 --> 09:25.680
You guys are annoying.

09:29.990 --> 09:31.420
Oh, that was a laugh.

09:31.990 --> 09:34.930
In the first place, what would you use the
chest hair for once you rip it off of him?

09:34.990 --> 09:37.460
Well, there was quite a bit, so a wig?

09:37.560 --> 09:38.090
From chest hair?.

09:41.230 --> 09:42.200
Wonderful!

09:43.270 --> 09:45.630
You're so soulful! Looking good, Guu-chan!

09:45.940 --> 09:47.340
Soulful?

09:47.410 --> 09:48.570
I'm home!

10:19.340 --> 10:20.430
Haré!

10:20.510 --> 10:23.530
Welcome to the hippest trip!

10:28.610 --> 10:30.600
Geez, you don't have the right groove.

10:30.680 --> 10:33.210
If you're like that,
the don will laugh at you, brother.

10:33.650 --> 10:35.180
That's not it, brother.

10:37.590 --> 10:40.110
Magical Touch, Enchanting Aroma!

10:40.490 --> 10:42.120
T-That wig...

10:42.190 --> 10:43.790
It's so cool and hip!

10:44.160 --> 10:46.220
Cool... and hip...

10:46.630 --> 10:49.690
Magical Touch, Enchanting Aroma!

10:49.970 --> 10:51.230
Yeah!

10:51.600 --> 10:52.370
It can't be...

10:52.440 --> 10:53.460
Elder's...?

10:53.910 --> 10:55.900
What? Something wrong with the elder?.

10:56.010 --> 10:57.300
N-Nothing!

10:57.780 --> 10:58.900
Guu, come with me!

11:00.710 --> 11:01.870
Where are you going?

11:02.280 --> 11:04.370
Mom wants to get down and fever, too!

11:04.480 --> 11:06.950
HARÉ+GUU

11:13.020 --> 11:14.890
That wig... No matter how you look at it...

11:18.360 --> 11:21.360
What should I do,
if such a thing came out into the open?

11:21.930 --> 11:26.270
It looks like the Elder doesn't remember,
but it's his chest hair that he values more
than his own life...

11:26.640 --> 11:27.660
At the worst, from the village, we'll be...

11:27.770 --> 11:29.670
Get out!

11:30.280 --> 11:32.070
Even that wouldn't be as bad as...

11:33.580 --> 11:35.510
For kids who cause such mischief...

11:37.220 --> 11:37.980
I have this!

11:38.180 --> 11:40.410
Major League Ball - Good Kid Cast!

11:53.900 --> 11:57.100
Nooo!

11:57.200 --> 11:59.070
Nooo!

12:03.270 --> 12:04.970
Haré? And Guu?

12:09.750 --> 12:10.680
You surprised me.

12:10.920 --> 12:12.380
l was the one that was surprised!

12:12.450 --> 12:13.350
What's going on?

12:13.550 --> 12:14.710
You know...

12:15.150 --> 12:16.880
I want to see the elder for a bit.

12:17.190 --> 12:18.250
Gramps?

12:21.290 --> 12:22.260
That afro...

12:22.330 --> 12:24.350
Well, this is, well, um...

12:24.430 --> 12:25.860
It's cool and hip.

12:26.030 --> 12:27.190
What?

12:29.600 --> 12:30.690
Wait just a minute.

12:30.900 --> 12:33.030
Gramps, you have a guest.

12:34.670 --> 12:36.570
Oh, you were right there, Gramps?

12:36.640 --> 12:37.540
Haré is here.

12:38.210 --> 12:38.970
Haré?

12:43.650 --> 12:45.810
If you have worries that you'd like to discuss,
I'll listen.

12:48.020 --> 12:49.680
Why does he have chest hair?.

12:50.220 --> 12:52.090
It was all ripped out a while ago.

12:53.060 --> 12:54.650
Oh, he grew more.

12:54.960 --> 12:57.520
But it hasn't even been a day.

12:57.860 --> 12:59.850
That's right. Ain't it gross?

12:59.930 --> 13:01.020
I'm telling you, it's too fast.

13:01.230 --> 13:03.720
No, I don't think it's such a simple problem.

13:04.970 --> 13:07.840
Well now, let's get all the talking done inside.

13:08.140 --> 13:11.230
Now, what do you want?

13:11.340 --> 13:14.940
Um, well, actually...

13:25.520 --> 13:26.550
Elder?

13:27.760 --> 13:31.020
Can it be that the elder remembers getting
his chest hair ripped out by Guu?

13:33.130 --> 13:34.830
Yeah! Cool and hip!

13:39.700 --> 13:41.970
He seems to be instinctively afraid.

13:43.440 --> 13:45.670
W-Welcome, Haré.

13:45.940 --> 13:49.040
But, I'm more worried about
him in this T-shirt.

13:49.380 --> 13:51.510
Now, Guu-san, please sit down.

13:51.580 --> 13:52.480
He added a "-san"?

13:52.950 --> 13:54.780
And, what brings you here today?

13:54.990 --> 13:57.010
Well, um...

13:57.290 --> 14:00.020
Is it all right to tell him now
that Guu ripped it off?

14:00.160 --> 14:02.090
It seems like the Elder is
scared stiff right now.

14:02.660 --> 14:05.150
Well, it's not much, actually.

14:05.260 --> 14:06.420
So never mind.

14:06.500 --> 14:08.060
I'm sorry to have bothered you.

14:08.270 --> 14:09.760
Guu, let's go. What are you looking at?

14:11.270 --> 14:12.000
Hair.

14:13.740 --> 14:15.210
That's enough. Let's get going.

14:26.050 --> 14:27.920
You don't have the right groove, brother.

14:28.090 --> 14:30.110
I'm saying, that's enough with that wig!

14:30.190 --> 14:31.850
Why don't you just put it away!?

14:37.260 --> 14:38.090
Yeah!

14:39.130 --> 14:40.030
She didn't...?

14:45.570 --> 14:46.540
Again!?

14:46.840 --> 14:48.070
Lots of ripping!

14:53.880 --> 14:58.080
Today's hunt has been cancelled due to our
Elder's sudden illness.

14:58.580 --> 15:03.390
Those of you that were planning to attend,
please gather your strength in preparation
for the next hunt.

15:03.390 --> 15:03.990
Those of you that were planning to attend,
please gather your strength in preparation
for the next hunt.
We won't be able to eat meat
again for a while.

15:03.990 --> 15:04.790
We won't be able to eat meat
again for a while.

15:04.790 --> 15:05.590
I repeat, today's hunt has been cancelled
due to our Elder's sudden illness.
We won't be able to eat meat
again for a while.

15:05.590 --> 15:05.720
I repeat, today's hunt has been cancelled
due to our Elder's sudden illness.

15:05.720 --> 15:07.660
I repeat, today's hunt has been cancelled
due to our Elder's sudden illness.
Hmm. No helping it.

15:07.660 --> 15:08.830
I repeat, today's hunt has been cancelled
due to our Elder's sudden illness.

15:08.830 --> 15:09.730
I repeat, today's hunt has been cancelled
due to our Elder's sudden illness.
Let's drink!

15:09.730 --> 15:09.860
I repeat, today's hunt has been cancelled
due to our Elder's sudden illness.

15:09.860 --> 15:10.190
I repeat, today's hunt has been cancelled
due to our Elder's sudden illness.
What? Why booze!?

15:10.190 --> 15:11.590
What? Why booze!?

15:11.830 --> 15:15.060
The announcement said,
gather one's strength!

15:15.130 --> 15:16.660
Why are you interpreting it to your liking?

15:16.770 --> 15:17.230
No!

15:17.300 --> 15:18.890
Oh, you're so cheap!

15:20.240 --> 15:22.800
Mom, I've been thinking this for a while...

15:23.170 --> 15:23.870
What?

15:27.310 --> 15:28.510
You've gained weight.

15:35.050 --> 15:35.640
You think so?

15:36.520 --> 15:37.220
Yeah.

15:41.160 --> 15:43.350
W-Why do you think so?

15:43.430 --> 15:46.060
Because you don't do any of the chores
around the house.

15:47.030 --> 15:48.620
You're so rude!

15:48.700 --> 15:51.260
Weda has been a lazy woman for quite a
while now!

15:51.470 --> 15:52.560
Guu-chan...

15:52.740 --> 15:54.140
You're not saying anything in her defense...

15:54.540 --> 15:57.600
But, it's true that I'm out of shape lately.

15:57.710 --> 16:01.040
it's really good exercise if I can go hunt.

16:01.210 --> 16:03.310
That's why I'm telling you, do more chores
around the house!

16:03.610 --> 16:05.710
But, what happened to the Elder?.

16:05.780 --> 16:07.770
He was so full of energy yesterday.

16:09.190 --> 16:12.120
According to the rumors, he's been hit with a
really bad disease...

16:12.290 --> 16:14.190
And he might not survive the night.

16:15.730 --> 16:19.690
So what Guu did yesterday really hurt him
psychologically?.

16:20.260 --> 16:22.630
And being unable to bear with it, he
collapsed...?

16:22.770 --> 16:25.570
Of course, this is a rumor that Guu started
just now.

16:27.640 --> 16:29.330
Ouch, ouch.

16:29.640 --> 16:32.130
It's true that his health isn't completely well.

16:33.110 --> 16:35.670
If you're that worried,
why don't you pay him a visit?

16:35.750 --> 16:36.440
Uh, sure.

16:37.010 --> 16:40.250
Then, take him something as a gift.

16:40.420 --> 16:42.010
Oh, you mean like fruits?

16:42.450 --> 16:43.110
Here.

16:43.390 --> 16:45.820
Why does it have to be alcohol? You drunk!

16:46.020 --> 16:47.190
Well, excuse me.

16:47.190 --> 16:51.030
It's common sense to give souvenirs and
gifts that you would like to receive yourself.

16:51.100 --> 16:52.560
Don't make it sound normal!

16:54.000 --> 16:56.130
I've had enough!
I'm going to go without gifts!

17:11.620 --> 17:12.580
Oh, Haré.

17:12.680 --> 17:15.350
Toposte, I'm here to visit the Elder.

17:15.490 --> 17:18.580
Oh, really?
You don't have to be so considerate.

17:18.960 --> 17:20.720
I'm making Gramps his meal right now.

17:20.960 --> 17:22.260
Oh, then let me help!

17:22.760 --> 17:24.960
Seaweed and pokute miso soup...

17:25.060 --> 17:27.050
Pokute and short seaweed saute...

17:27.130 --> 17:28.560
Pokute roll...

17:29.030 --> 17:30.630
Whew, I guess this is enough.

17:31.270 --> 17:33.240
How is the elder...?

17:33.640 --> 17:37.070
Gramps is cooped up in his room, and he
doesn't want to come out.

17:37.170 --> 17:38.770
So, he's not sick or anything?

17:39.010 --> 17:41.910
Yeah... I think it's more like something
emotional.

17:42.650 --> 17:44.250
I don't think you know this, Haré...

17:44.250 --> 17:48.150
But after you and Guu went home yesterday,
Gramps had his chest hair ripped out again.

17:48.320 --> 17:50.120
I definitely know about that.

17:50.250 --> 17:51.920
That was a big shock to him.

17:52.660 --> 17:55.060
Since then, he hasn't had any new chest hair
growing in at all.

17:57.830 --> 17:59.560
T-That's impossible!

18:00.230 --> 18:02.700
Or rather, it's not something to be so
surprised about.

18:02.900 --> 18:06.130
I mean, isn't it more like the way he should
look as an ordinary human?

18:06.670 --> 18:07.970
You might be right...

18:08.470 --> 18:10.570
But, but...

18:10.840 --> 18:14.330
I really prefer Gramps with all his chest hair.

18:14.450 --> 18:16.540
Toposte, don't cry.

18:16.910 --> 18:20.540
Why are all the people around me slightly
demented like this?

18:21.450 --> 18:23.480
Come on now, someone's here, Toposte.

18:23.890 --> 18:25.010
Y-Yeah.

18:26.520 --> 18:28.920
If Gramps wakes up,
listen to what he has to say.

18:29.060 --> 18:30.150
S-Sure.

18:33.330 --> 18:35.700
Amazingly smooth.

18:36.330 --> 18:38.500
I wonder what it feels like.

18:43.940 --> 18:45.140
It's you, Haré...

18:45.980 --> 18:46.880
Welcome.

18:46.980 --> 18:47.910
Are you all right?

18:51.380 --> 18:54.180
Such a pathetic chest I have,
with nothing on it.

18:54.590 --> 18:56.990
If you want to laugh,
you can go ahead and laugh.

18:57.120 --> 18:58.320
No, that's okay.

18:58.420 --> 19:00.950
To think that my macho hair isn't growing in.

19:01.430 --> 19:03.090
I'm in an amazingly huge slump.

19:03.230 --> 19:05.560
What's this about a chest hair slump?

19:05.700 --> 19:08.030
Come to think, is Guu-sama doing well?

19:08.170 --> 19:10.500
Y-Yeah, sort of.

19:10.770 --> 19:12.360
It's finally gotten to him
calling her "-sama" now?.

19:12.840 --> 19:14.330
Gramps, someone's here to see you.

19:14.570 --> 19:16.630
I have a lot of guests today...

19:17.380 --> 19:18.030
Hey.

19:18.710 --> 19:19.770
Guu-sama!

19:19.880 --> 19:21.370
What are you here for?.

19:21.610 --> 19:22.480
Visiting.

19:24.320 --> 19:25.410
Oh, he froze.

19:25.520 --> 19:27.040
You're lacking energy.

19:27.120 --> 19:28.520
Once again, hey!

19:30.760 --> 19:32.810
Hey! It certainly is.

19:33.190 --> 19:35.950
I am sorry you have to see me in this state.

19:36.560 --> 19:39.260
As the village elder, and the hunting leader...

19:39.260 --> 19:41.530
I must say I am so pathetic.

19:42.070 --> 19:43.830
I wonder why it doesn't grow?

19:44.340 --> 19:46.530
I believe it's something psychological.

19:47.000 --> 19:48.340
Looking so pained...

19:48.410 --> 19:49.810
And whose fault is it?

19:50.070 --> 19:53.640
To think that so many people would see me
like this, without chest hair...

19:53.640 --> 19:55.940
Makes me unable to step outside!

19:56.180 --> 19:59.240
I wouldn't want people to see me with chest
hair, actually.

19:59.720 --> 20:02.580
But the elder really needs
his chest hair that much.

20:02.990 --> 20:05.920
if it's this serious, it might be impossible to
drag him outside again.

20:05.990 --> 20:08.120
That doesn't matter. Come outside.

20:08.290 --> 20:08.760
Yes, ma'am.

20:09.060 --> 20:10.320
Eh, it was that easy?.

20:10.490 --> 20:12.660
I will step outside.

20:12.760 --> 20:14.530
He obeys her every order.

20:14.730 --> 20:17.570
But in such a pathetic shape...

20:18.040 --> 20:18.970
Elder.

20:19.970 --> 20:20.900
What are you doing?

20:21.010 --> 20:22.030
A gift with my sympathy.

20:24.840 --> 20:25.670
It can't be...

20:28.510 --> 20:31.040
T-That's...

20:35.990 --> 20:39.290
You should head out to the hunt after tying
this to your chest.

20:39.360 --> 20:42.660
Oh, Guu-sama!

20:46.460 --> 20:49.520
Is she kind, or is she ruthless?

20:52.870 --> 20:55.460
Meat, meat, meat!

20:55.710 --> 20:57.870
Night time hunting is full of danger.

20:58.080 --> 20:59.910
Don't be caught off guard!

21:04.720 --> 21:08.010
All right!
We're seriously going to get down tonight!

21:08.390 --> 21:11.580
Follow me! Don't get lost!

21:11.690 --> 21:12.290
First it gets cancelled, then it gets started
up again. What's up with this?

21:12.290 --> 21:14.730
Let's go! Forward, forward!
First it gets cancelled, then it gets started
up again. What's up with this?

21:14.730 --> 21:14.790
Let's go! Forward, forward!

21:14.790 --> 21:15.460
Let's go! Forward, forward!
But more than that,
I'm concerned about that...

21:15.460 --> 21:17.190
But more than that,
I'm concerned about that...

21:20.000 --> 21:24.560
All right!

22:34.940 --> 22:35.470
NEXT EPISODE

22:35.470 --> 22:38.640
Oh, morning Wadi. You're pretty tense today,
or rather, you're always too tense!

22:38.640 --> 22:40.310
What are you suddenly trying to start!

22:40.310 --> 22:42.350
Are they not getting along? I'm worried.

22:42.350 --> 22:43.550
No there's got to be something there!

22:43.550 --> 22:45.080
I can't be doing this, I have to stop them.
Wait, they're laughing! And it's really frank!

22:45.080 --> 22:46.180
I can't be doing this, I have to stop them.
Wait, they're laughing! And it's really frank!

22:46.180 --> 22:48.720
Furthermore, she starts to pretend that we're
like that stupid couple, and tries to have a
lover's quarrel with me.

22:48.720 --> 22:49.850
What are you thinking Guu?

22:49.850 --> 22:52.660
Oh that's right, all you can think about is how
you can cause me trouble.

22:52.660 --> 22:55.030
There's no way that I can say that line that
makes my teeth rattle and plunges my soul
into the stratosphere!

22:55.030 --> 22:56.090
Wait, Marie, you were watching?

22:56.090 --> 22:59.060
Oh, Marie, that's exactly the reaction that I
expected! Come back!

22:59.060 --> 22:59.960
And Guu, you stop acting like Mom!

22:59.960 --> 23:01.500
Morning Smooch And Guu you stop acting like Mom!

23:01.500 --> 23:03.660
Next episode of Haré+Guu:

23:04.570 --> 23:04.930
Morning Smooch
